 "vs_baseline": "U11 post-hoc on the same harness is +1.00 calls, +1.9% of $ [1.2, 2.9]; pre-emptive is +2.1 calls, +3.9%. One average call is 3.0% of Haiku $ ($0.0078). Credible learned shaping (-0.7% [-1.4, 0.0]) does not beat U11. Re-read dedupe (+0.95%) is about half of U11 post-hoc and additive to it. Only the TTL config (+11.7%) is bigger.",
